Z||000014||Fiero5||04-25-2001||05:48 PM||||For us people in Plainfield NH who need scoops shipped, I would recommend the good 'ole post office. <P>However, we have a local bus station near us- Vermont Transit. It is on the border of NH in White River Jct. Vermont near where I live. It is a division of Greyhound I think. You can ship the scoops thru Greyhound to Vermont Transit in White River Jct. Vermont.<BR>That's assuming they are not allready on the way?<P>Steve||||reg||12
